.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK PROJECT EDIT"
.SH NAME
hamstik project edit \- Edit a project (Organization administrators only)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik project edit [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Edit a project (Organization administrators only)
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I KEY
Project key
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --name
New name
.TP
.B --description
New description text
.TP
.B --description-file
New description source (path, or - for stdin)
.TP
.B --description-editor
Author the description in $VISUAL/$EDITOR instead of passing text
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --color
New display color as a hex string
.TP
.B --clear-description
Clear the description
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --force
Bypass revision conflict protection (If-Match: *)
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
